  "html": "<img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5451eab5e4b0d6969dc1ec71/925e4c1e-c29a-4af5-b4c8-1dc822232cea/IMG_9393.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"\"/>\n  \n\n\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living</strong> in Berlin, Germany. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\"><strong>Learning</strong> German on Duolingo.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Running</strong> three times a week.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Swimming</strong> once a week.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Writing</strong> a daily-ish <a href=\"https://garage.madebyal.net\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>blog</strong></a> and a monthly-ish <a href=\"https://madebyal.kit.com/6f92645e25\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Newsletter</strong></a>.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\"><strong>Co-Hosting</strong> a </span><a href=\"https://anchor.fm/alxal-podcast\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\"><strong><em>monthly podcast</em></strong></span></a><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\"> with my friend </span><a href=\"https://alsiew.com\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\">Al Siew</span></a><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\">.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/13631897-al\"><strong>Currently reading:</strong></a> <em>If an Egyptian Cannot Speak English</em> by Noor Naga, <em>Everything Is Tuberculosis</em> by John Green, and This Arab Is Queer<em> </em>(edited) by Elias Jahshan.</p></li></ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p st